        "text": "I'm not sure how to mitigate that, though."
      },
      {
        "label": "initializing",
        "text": "Overall, I think the key points are association vs causation, reverse causation, selection bias, and designing a randomized trial to establish causation. I need to make sure I explain each part clearly and relate it to the given scenario."
      }
