      },
      {
        "label": "initializing",
        "text": "First, let me write down the sequence again to see the pattern clearly:\n\nTerm 1: 7\n\nTerm 2: 4\n\nTerm 3: 11\n\nTerm 4: 15\n\nTerm 5: 26\n\nTerm 6: 41\n\nTerm 7: 67\n\nTerm 8: 108"
      },
      {
