        "text": "So, starting from Term 3, each term is the sum of the two previous terms, but then we apply a different modulus each time. The problem says that the modular operation changes based on the term's position. So, Term 3 uses one modulus, Term 4 uses another, and so on. I need to figure out what modulus is being used for each term."
      },
      {
        "label": "initializing",
        "text": "Let me list the terms with their positions:\n\nTerm 1: 7\n\nTerm 2: 4\n\nTerm 3: 11\n\nTerm 4: 15\n\nTerm 5: 26\n\nTerm 6: 41\n\nTerm 7: 67\n\nTerm 8: 108"
