        "text": "So, Term 3 is 11, which is Term1 + Term2 = 7 + 4 = 11. Then, Term3 is 11. Now, Term4 is 15, which is Term2 + Term3 = 4 + 11 = 15. So, Term4 is 15. Then Term5 is 26, which is Term3 + Term4 = 11 + 15 = 26. Term6 is 41, which is Term4 + Term5 = 15 + 26 = 41. Term7 is 67, which is Term5 + Term6 = 26 + 41 = 67. Term8 is 108, which is Term6 + Term7 = 41 + 67 = 108."
