        "label": "deduction",
        "text": "2. **Rapid Death and Volcanic Eruption**: If the dinosaur died rapidly, maybe the surrounding area experienced a volcanic eruption that produced the ash."
      },
      {
        "label": "deduction",
        "text": "But the nearby volcano was 300 km away, so it's unlikely that a nearby volcano would cause such a massive eruption."
      },
      {
        "label": "uncertainty-estimation",
        "text": "Maybe a distant volcano, but that doesn't make much sense either."
