        "text": "Okay, so I have this problem about a conical tent. It says the base is a circle with a radius of 4 meters, and the height is 6 meters. There's a rope that needs to be wrapped around the outside in a spiral from a point on the edge of the base to the apex (tip) of the cone. I need to find the minimum length of the rope."
      },
      {
        "label": "adding-knowledge",
        "text": "Hmm, okay, so I remember that when dealing with cones, especially when you unfold them, they become flat sectors of circles. Maybe that can help me find the shortest path."
      },
