think that's the case. Maybe I'm missing a rule here.\n\nWait, perhaps I need to think of a different container. Maybe \"water\" is a container, so it transforms into \"water.\" But that's not helpful. Alternatively, maybe \"water\" is a process, but I don't think that's the case. Maybe I'm stuck here.\n\nWait, perhaps I",
