      },
      {
        "label": "deduction",
        "text": "Thus, the statement holds for \\( n+1 \\), completing the induction."
      },
      {
        "label": "deduction",
        "text": "Therefore, \\( b_n = 2^n + 1 \\) for all positive integers \\( n \\)."
      }
    ],
