h.\n\n**Example Transformations:**\n- **APPLE (A, R, C, R, E)**\n  - A → C (A + 1)\n  - R → R (R + 1)\n  - C → N (C + 2)\n  - R → G (R + 2)\n  - E → L (E + 3)\n  - **CRRNG**\n\n- **BREAD (B, R, A, D, C)**\n  - B → D (B + 1)\n  - R → T (R + 1)\n  - A → J (A + 2)\n  - D → F (D + 2)\n  - C → G (C + 3)\n  - **DTGCF**\n\n- **CHAIR (C, H, A, R, E)**\n  - C → E (C + 1)\n  - H → J (H + 2)\n  - A → K (A + 2)\n  - R → S (R + 3)\n  - E → H (E + 3)\n  - **EJCKR**\n\n**Transformation of TIGER (T, I, G",
